 <h3><u>Mimbar jaane haider jaane</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>[Chhed diya hai zikr e maula<br> mimbar jaane haider jaane]..(2)</p> 
  <p>kufr hai gar ye ishq ali ka<br> kafar jaane haider jaane</p> 
  <p>1. Binte asad to jaengi har haal me kaabe ke andar..(2)<br> darr hogi deewar kaha se<br> maadar jaane haider jaane</p> 
  <p>2. Ismaeel ye soch rahe the<br> kyu gardan par haath rakhu<br> naam e ali hai mere labo par<br> khanjar jaane haider jaane</p> 
  <p>3. Fatha likhi hai daste khuda par ab bhi mere pyaare habeeb..(2)<br> naade aliyan kehke bulale<br> khaiber jaane haider jaane</p> 
  <p>4. Aarefa e aijaz e ali hai<br> maadar hai ummat to nahi<br> bint e asad ko fikr nahi hai<br> ajdar jaane haider jaane</p> 
  <p>5. Jung e ohod me mera maula shaakh se sar karta hai qalam..(2)<br> tegh falak se aae na aae<br> lashkar jaane haider jaane</p> 
  <p>6. Ishq e ali ke dawe daro<br> rabb ki ibadat lazim hai<br> ye keh kar mat jaan chhudao<br> mehshar jaane haider jaane</p> 
  <p>7. Sher e khuda ka pota hai ye kehkar maa ne bhej diya..(2)<br> ladta hai ab kese rann me<br> asghar jaane haider jaane</p> 
  <p>8. Shaam me aur meraj nabi me<br> ek hi lehja goya tha<br> kisne rakha hai kiska parda<br> dukhtar jaane haider jaane</p> 
  <p>9. Mir hasan aur sibt e jafar<br> banda e haider hai dono<br> inke kafan par likhwa dena<br> naukar jaane haider jaane</p> 
